  - m_Id: 2262749212
    m_Localized: Turn Order Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749213
    m_Localized: Closest to the target throws last
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749214
    m_Localized: A target appears somewhere new in the house each game. Each side
      draws one stone as close to it as possible; the closer one throws last in end
      1. Stopping short of the min line or going past the back line leaves no record.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749215
    m_Localized: '{name} throws first'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 2262749216
    m_Localized: Turn order shot result
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749217
    m_Localized: '{name} throws last'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 2262749218
    m_Localized: The two records were equal, so a coin toss decided it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749219
    m_Localized: '{name} was closer to the target and throws the last shot of end
      1.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 2262749220
    m_Localized: It stopped short of the min line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749221
    m_Localized: It went off the sheet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2262749222
    m_Localized: '{name} throws first.'
